# Witness: a unit the lane did not measure per

Per instruction is what the log says and per cycle is what the register claims. A per-operation
attribution divided by the wrong operation is a different figure wearing the same number.

| Measurement | Unit | Candidate | Control | JIT | Native AOT |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `meter-per-instruction` | cycle | One invocation with fuel charging on | The same executor with charging off | 0.0000 | 0.0000 |
